{"4830610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Treasure Simulator", "steam_appid": 4830610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Fully Open World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/46ac68c509b8813c217ce7d2888282fd.poster.avif?t=1786428836\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/46ac68c509b8813c217ce7d2888282fd.webm?t=1786428836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/46ac68c509b8813c217ce7d2888282fd.mp4?t=1786428836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a rich and immersive world with complete freedom. Haggle with grumpy street vendors, browse valuable treasures in reputable antique stores, uncover hidden gems in second-hand shops, or cautiously acquire mysterious goods from the black market. Travel across different regions in search of opportunities that can bring you fortune and success. And when business slows down, relax and enjoy yourself at the local tavern.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Negotiation &amp; Character Growth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/da0b76a0f27fa974a2f3db463662a7c6.poster.avif?t=1786428836\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/da0b76a0f27fa974a2f3db463662a7c6.webm?t=1786428836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/da0b76a0f27fa974a2f3db463662a7c6.mp4?t=1786428836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Negotiation is an art. Adapt your bargaining strategy to customers with different personalities. Will you push for a better deal at the risk of losing the transaction, or settle for a reasonable profit? Will you deceive customers for massive gains, or build a reputation through honest business practices? Your choices will directly determine the success or failure of your shop. Gain experience through every transaction, unlock new skills, and gradually grow into a master negotiator.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shop Management &amp; Hiring</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/edd90166347001b88c3bdb6a104d0767.poster.avif?t=1786428836\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/edd90166347001b88c3bdb6a104d0767.webm?t=1786428836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/edd90166347001b88c3bdb6a104d0767.mp4?t=1786428836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase display cases of varying quality according to your financial situation and decorate your shop with valuable artifacts to increase its appeal and transaction value. Expand your business as it grows, customize the appearance of your storefront, and create a shop that reflects your personal style. Hire assistants to help manage daily operations, automate transactions, catch thieves, and handle unexpected situations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Campaign</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/f87ec24f7895ff01e3165abd1f3a3d8a.poster.avif?t=1786428836\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/f87ec24f7895ff01e3165abd1f3a3d8a.webm?t=1786428836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/f87ec24f7895ff01e3165abd1f3a3d8a.mp4?t=1786428836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tense conflict between government forces and rebels has engulfed the local town. Visitors from both factions will frequently come to your shop seeking assistance. Satisfy their requests to ensure your survival, and when the time comes, choose a side. Your decision will shape the course of the story and lead to one of several unique endings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Treasure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/c8bf4bfbb009c652b907ba94e680729b.poster.avif?t=1786428836\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/c8bf4bfbb009c652b907ba94e680729b.webm?t=1786428836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/c8bf4bfbb009c652b907ba94e680729b.mp4?t=1786428836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from nearly a thousand unique collectibles and antiques. Carefully inspect and evaluate each item to uncover its hidden value and investment potential. Personally perform appraisal, restoration, forgery, and other specialized operations. Your judgment, reflexes, and decision-making skills will determine the ultimate profit you can earn from every treasure.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Fully Open World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/46ac68c509b8813c217ce7d2888282fd.poster.avif?t=1786428836\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/46ac68c509b8813c217ce7d2888282fd.webm?t=1786428836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/46ac68c509b8813c217ce7d2888282fd.mp4?t=1786428836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a rich and immersive world with complete freedom. Haggle with grumpy street vendors, browse valuable treasures in reputable antique stores, uncover hidden gems in second-hand shops, or cautiously acquire mysterious goods from the black market. Travel across different regions in search of opportunities that can bring you fortune and success. And when business slows down, relax and enjoy yourself at the local tavern.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Negotiation &amp; Character Growth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/da0b76a0f27fa974a2f3db463662a7c6.poster.avif?t=1786428836\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/da0b76a0f27fa974a2f3db463662a7c6.webm?t=1786428836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/da0b76a0f27fa974a2f3db463662a7c6.mp4?t=1786428836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Negotiation is an art. Adapt your bargaining strategy to customers with different personalities. Will you push for a better deal at the risk of losing the transaction, or settle for a reasonable profit? Will you deceive customers for massive gains, or build a reputation through honest business practices? Your choices will directly determine the success or failure of your shop. Gain experience through every transaction, unlock new skills, and gradually grow into a master negotiator.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shop Management &amp; Hiring</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/edd90166347001b88c3bdb6a104d0767.poster.avif?t=1786428836\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/edd90166347001b88c3bdb6a104d0767.webm?t=1786428836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/edd90166347001b88c3bdb6a104d0767.mp4?t=1786428836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase display cases of varying quality according to your financial situation and decorate your shop with valuable artifacts to increase its appeal and transaction value. Expand your business as it grows, customize the appearance of your storefront, and create a shop that reflects your personal style. Hire assistants to help manage daily operations, automate transactions, catch thieves, and handle unexpected situations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Campaign</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/f87ec24f7895ff01e3165abd1f3a3d8a.poster.avif?t=1786428836\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/f87ec24f7895ff01e3165abd1f3a3d8a.webm?t=1786428836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/f87ec24f7895ff01e3165abd1f3a3d8a.mp4?t=1786428836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tense conflict between government forces and rebels has engulfed the local town. Visitors from both factions will frequently come to your shop seeking assistance. Satisfy their requests to ensure your survival, and when the time comes, choose a side. Your decision will shape the course of the story and lead to one of several unique endings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Treasure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/c8bf4bfbb009c652b907ba94e680729b.poster.avif?t=1786428836\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/c8bf4bfbb009c652b907ba94e680729b.webm?t=1786428836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830610/extras/c8bf4bfbb009c652b907ba94e680729b.mp4?t=1786428836\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from nearly a thousand unique collectibles and antiques. Carefully inspect and evaluate each item to uncover its hidden value and investment potential. Personally perform appraisal, restoration, forgery, and other specialized operations. Your judgment, reflexes, and decision-making skills will determine the ultimate profit you can earn from every treasure.</p>", "short_description": "Search the world for hidden treasures with untapped potential. Haggle, restore, or even forge items to turn a profit. Upgrade your skills, expand your shop, hire employees, and rise to become a master treasure hunter. Survive amid the escalating conflict between the government and rebel forces.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - 